  "title": "R23: roadmap-status reports the real activation state for allocation, strategy, speculation and Jev points (speculation is off, not active) and regenerates roadmap-status.json",
  "spec": "Why: .orchestrator/roadmap-status.json on goal/T-0561 (generated by orchestrator/roadmap.py, T-0669) lists adaptive-parallelism-p17 (speculation) as implemented_active although pool.toml [speculation].mode = \"off\", and adaptive-parallelism-p16 (allocation, [allocation].mode = \"shadow\"), adaptive-parallelism-p18 (strategy, [strategy].mode = \"shadow\") and phase-i-p7 (Jev decision points, [jev.points].* = \"shadow\") are not derived from their mode keys either. The brief's completion rule depends on activation state being right: experimental features must show shadow or off.\nWhat (orchestrator/roadmap.py REQUIREMENTS entries and tests/test_roadmap.py; unittest.TestCase methods, import _harness first):\n- Give each requirement its mode_key: adaptive-parallelism-p16 -> allocation.mode; adaptive-parallelism-p17 -> speculation.mode; adaptive-parallelism-p18 -> strategy.mode; phase-i-p7 -> jev.points.scout_necessity (representative; document that all four points share the default); phase-i-p5 -> jev.routing.mode; adaptive-parallelism-p15 -> scheduler.jev_mode; adaptive-parallelism-p5/p6/p11/p13 -> scheduler.mode (they apply only when waves are active) if not already so; verify every other mode_key matches the table.key the module reads.\n- status(): a mode of \"off\" yields implemented_off, \"shadow\" implemented_shadow, \"active\" implemented_active; unknown or missing value falls back to the module default documented in promotion.FEATURES when the feature is registered there.\n- Regenerate .orchestrator/roadmap-status.json with `orchestrator roadmap-status --write` and commit it; complete must remain true.",
  "inputs": [],
  "acceptance": [
    "tests/test_roadmap.py::test_experimental_features_report_their_configured_mode \u2014 with pool.toml values speculation off, allocation shadow, strategy shadow, jev.points shadow the statuses are implemented_off, implemented_shadow, implemented_shadow, implemented_shadow",
    "tests/test_roadmap.py::test_build_on_repo_marks_goal_complete \u2014 still passes and the regenerated .orchestrator/roadmap-status.json has summary.implemented_off >= 1 and complete true"
  ],
